{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A daemon that keeps "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"actor"},{"type":"text","text":" in the player’s room: each turn, if the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"actor is onstage but elsewhere, it teleports to wherever the player"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"now stands. Daemons tick at the end of the turn, after the player’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"go","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" has resolved and the new room is described, so the companion"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"catches up the same turn and its "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"arrival"},{"text":" line trails the room","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"description. The line prints only when the destination is lit: in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the dark the companion arrives unseen. There is deliberately no"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"departure","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" line — the companion only ever moves ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"to","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" the player,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"so no one is ever in the room it leaves to watch it go (unlike","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"roams","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"). The daemon idles while the actor is offstage — including","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"after ","type":"text"},{"code":"vanish()","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" — and the host may ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"stopDaemon(_:)"},{"text":" to park the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"companion for a “wait here” beat, then ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"startDaemon(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":" to resume."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"It draws no randomness at all (unlike "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"roams"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"steals"},{"type":"text","text":"), so a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"following companion never perturbs the seeded stream: "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"arrivals"},{"text":" is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"cycled by the saved turn counter, so the line varies from arrival to","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"arrival yet stays deterministic across save and restore. Pass one"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"line for a fixed announcement, a dozen so a constant companion does"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"not wear his welcome out. Start the companion co-located with the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"player ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"starts(in:)"},{"text":" the player’s start room) to avoid a spurious","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"arrival on turn one.","type":"text"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/GnustoActors\/documentation\/GnustoActors","doc:\/\/GnustoActors\/documentation\/GnustoActors\/ActorBehaviors"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"follows"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"_","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"actor","kind":"internalParam"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"text":"Actor","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/Actor","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto5ActorV"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"text":"named","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"name","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"rooms","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"text":"Location","identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/Location","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto8LocationV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"]? = nil, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"when","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"condition","kind":"internalParam"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"text":"@escaping ","kind":"attribute"},{"text":"@Sendable","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" () -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Bool","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"kind":"text","text":" = { true }, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"arrivals"},{"kind":"text","text":": ["},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":"] = []) -> "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto10TimedEventV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"TimedEvent","identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/TimedEvent"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"parameters":[{"name":"actor","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The companion NPC.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"name":"name","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The daemon’s global timer name.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"name":"rooms","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The destinations he will walk into; ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"text":" for anywhere.","type":"text"}]}]},{"name":"condition","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"An extra gate, checked first — a false gate is a quiet turn.","type":"text"}]}]},{"name":"arrivals","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Lines printed when the companion catches up, if lit —","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"cycled by the turn counter; empty for a silent companion.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"kind":"parameters"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"return-value","text":"Return Value","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The following daemon, for the host’s ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"timers"},{"text":" block.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"rooms:"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"code":"when:","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" are the two ways to scope a follower, and they"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"scope different things. "},{"code":"rooms:","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is a whitelist of "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"destinations"}]},{"type":"text","text":" — a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"gaoler who walks the corridors and will not set foot in a cell follows"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"you along the one and lets you go into the other, which is what makes","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"“somewhere he will not go” a place you can stand. ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"when:"},{"text":" is an extra","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"gate evaluated first, exactly as ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoActors\/documentation\/GnustoActors\/ActorBehaviors\/roams(_:named:rooms:chancePerTurn:when:arrival:departure:)"},{"text":"’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"is, for the companion who has been told to wait. Either left out is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"always open, so a caller that passes neither behaves exactly as before.","type":"text"}]}],"kind":"content"}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/GnustoActors\/documentation\/GnustoActors\/ActorBehaviors\/follows(_:named:rooms:when:arrivals:)"},"kind":"symbol","seeAlsoSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/GnustoActors\/documentation\/GnustoActors\/ActorBehaviors\/roams(_:named:rooms:chancePerTurn:when:arrival:departure:)"],"anchor":"Moving-an-actor","title":"Moving an actor","generated":true}],"variants":[{"traits":[{